ckground-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\" class=\"acyeditor_text\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/index.php/ct-menu-item-11\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/ebcbb8eb50.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a></td>\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"520\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 500px; margin: 15px auto;\" class=\"acyeditor_text\">\r\n<h3>Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</h3>\r\n<p>wir schulen morgen ab 16 Uhr für unsere A-Scheinaspiranten in Lindenfels. Lindenfles ist ein Höhenfluggelände, die Flüge zählen also schon für den A-Schein. Die Schulung ist für alle die sich zur Zeit in der Grundausbildung befinden. Neuanfänger, die noch nicht da waren, können morgen nicht teilnehmen.</p>\r\n<p>Anfahrts-/Geländebeschreibung Lindenfels:</p>\r\n<p>http://www.fs-hirondelle.de/index.php/ct-menu-item-28/9-articles/53-lindenfels</p>\r\n<p>Geschult wird ab 4 Schüler. Bitte per Mail bis morgen 24.04.15 um 11 Uhr anmelden. Ob geschult wird seht ihr dann um 12 Uhr auf der Startseite.</p>\r\n<p>Sehr wahrscheinlich geht am Samstag, wetterbedingt, leider nichts! Für Sonntag müssen wir dann schauen.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Viele Grüße</strong></em><br /><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>               <br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span> -  </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -  69469 Weinheim -  Germany<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"> </p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"> <span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><em>Alex: </em></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)151 / 18836000</span> - <span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Karsten: </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)173 / 3485831</span></em></span></p>\r\n</address>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: #e2341d; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"color: #e2341d; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Kontonummer: 160 52 16</span>  <span style=\"color: #e2341d; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Bankleitzahl: 670 923 00</span>  <span style=\"color: #e2341d; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Volksbank Weinheim<br />I B A N: DE51670923000001605216      B I C: GENODE61WNM</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /><br /></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Bitte tragen Sie uns in Ihr Adressbuch ein, <br />um einen einwandfreien Empfang zu ermöglichen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" height=\"40px\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/bottom.png\" alt=\"---\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"info acyeditor_delete acyeditor_text\">Kein Interesse mehr am Newsletter? {unsubscribe}Unsubscribe{/unsubscribe}</div>\r\n</div>','SENT',NULL,'2015-04-23 12:41:27.000','2015-04-23 12:38:56.000','2026-09-20 10:04:35.635','NEWSLETTER',391,148,0,1,'Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de','Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),('17c36c9e-1e7a-44df-955d-8922d6148518','Tandemflüge über Pfingsten in den Vogesen','Tandemflüge über Pfingsten in den Vogesen',NULL,'<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%; background-color: #fff;\">\r\n<table style=\"text-align: justify; margin: auto; background-color: #ebebeb; border: 1px solid #e7e7e7; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #69b4c0;\" valign=\"bottom\" height=\"38px\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/top.png\" alt=\" - - - \" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"600\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" style=\"margin: auto; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"520\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/message_icon.png\" alt=\"-\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px; float: left;\" />\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">NEWSLETTER</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/index.php/ct-menu-item-11\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/ebcbb8eb50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 500px; margin: 15px auto;\" width=\"520\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</span></h3>\r\n<p>wir fahren von Donnerstag, 1.6. bis Pfingstmontag 5.6. in die Vogesen. Die Vogesen sind ein herrliches Fluggebiet - ideal f&uuml;r Tandemfl&uuml;ge.</p>\r\n<p>Wir haben in den f&uuml;nf Tagen unseren Tandemschirm dabei und k&ouml;nnen euch gerne dort vor Ort in die Luft bringen, wenn ihr wollt und die eigene Anreise in die Vogesen nicht scheut. Ideal, dies mit einem Pfingstausflug zu verbinden und mit einem Tandemflug zu kr&ouml;nen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Treffpunkt: Campingplatz in Urb&egrave;s.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"images/1-reisen/platzhalter_vogesen.jpg\" alt=\"platzhalter vogesen\" width=\"500\" height=\"225\" /></p>\r\n<p>Wenn Interesse besteht, einen Flug w&auml;hrend der f&uuml;nf Tage zu machen, meldet euch bitte per Mail bei uns mit Name, R&uuml;ckrufnummer und den gew&uuml;nschten/ m&ouml;glichen Tag/en. Wir melden uns dann bei euch zwecks konkreter Terminvereinbarung.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><em><strong>Luftige Gr&uuml;&szlig;e</strong></em></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -&nbsp; 69469 Weinheim &nbsp;| &nbsp;Am Birnbach 6 - 76829 Landau<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><em>Telefon: </em></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)151 / 18836000</span></span></em></span></p>\r\n</address>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Sparkasse S&Uuml;W<br />IBAN: DE32 5485 0010 1700 1976 41&nbsp; <br />BIC: SOLADES1SUW<br /><br /></span><strong>Bitte tragen Sie uns in Ihr Adressbuch ein, <br />um einen einwandfreien Empfang zu erm&ouml;glichen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" valign=\"bottom\" height=\"40px\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/bottom.png\" alt=\"---\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"info acyeditor_delete acyeditor_text\">Kein Interesse mehr am Newsletter? {unsubscribe}Unsubscribe{/unsubscribe}</div>\r\n</div>','SENT',NULL,'2017-05-30 18:05:00.000','2017-05-30 18:03:54.000','2026-09-20 10:04:37.818','TANDEM',289,119,0,1,'Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de','Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),('180870d9-9280-47b4-8d7c-5ffbc7032678','Schulungsnewsletter der Flugschule Hirondelle','Schulungsnewsletter der Flugschule Hirondelle',NULL,'<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%; background-color: #fff;\">\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: auto; background-color: #ebebeb; border: 1px solid #e7e7e7; width: 600px;\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" height=\"38px\" style=\"background-color: #69b4c0;\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/top.png\" alt=\" - - - \" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"600\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin: auto; width: 600px;\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"> </td>\r\n<td width=\"520\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #ebebeb;\" class=\"acyeditor_text\"><img style=\"margin: 0px 10px; float: left;\" src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/message_icon.png\" alt=\"-\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" />\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">NEWSLETTER</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"> </td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\" class=\"acyeditor_text\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/index.php/ct-menu-item-11\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/ebcbb8eb50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a></td>\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"> </td>\r\n<td width=\"520\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 500px; margin: 15px auto;\" class=\"acyeditor_text\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</span></h3>\r\n<p>morgen am Samstag, 10.9.16 sind wir mit unseren Neuanfängern um 9 Uhr in unserem Gelände in Stauf.</p>\r\n<p>Anfahrts-/Geländebeschreibung Stauf:<br /><br /><a>http://www.fs-hirondelle.de/nutzungsbedingungen/9-performance/57-stauf</a></p>\r\n<p>Für unsere Grundkursler die weiter machen wollen haben wir morgen noch 6 Plätze gleich zu Beginn frei.</p>\r\n<p>Wie immer gilt - Grundkursler bitte per Email anmelden.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><em><strong>Viele Grüße</strong></em></span><br /><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>               <br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span> -  </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -  69469 Weinheim -  Germany<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"> </p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><em>Telefon: </em></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)151 / 18836000</span></span></em></span></p>\r\n</address>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Sparkasse SÜW<br />IBAN: DE32 5485 0010 1700 1976 41  <br />BIC: SOLADES1SUW<br /><br /></span><strong>Bitte tragen Sie uns in Ihr Adressbuch ein, <br />um einen einwandfreien Empfang zu ermöglichen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"> </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" height=\"40px\" style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/bottom.png\" alt=\"---\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"info acyeditor_delete acyeditor_text\">Kein Interesse mehr am Newsletter? {unsubscribe}Unsubscribe{/unsubscribe}</div>\r\n</div>','SENT',NULL,'2016-09-09 07:19:51.000','2016-09-09 07:17:54.000','2026-09-20 10:04:37.053','NEWSLETTER',559,203,0,1,'Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de','Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),('182cf082-c9a4-4cba-ae1b-91768d90c978','Tandemflüge morgen am Samstag, 7.5.16','Tandemflüge morgen am Samstag, 7.5.16',NULL,'<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%; background-color: #fff;\">\r\n<table style=\"text-align: justify; margin: auto; background-color: #ebebeb; border: 1px solid #e7e7e7; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #69b4c0;\" valign=\"bottom\" height=\"38px\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/top.png\" alt=\" - - - \" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"600\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" style=\"margin: auto; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"520\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/message_icon.png\" alt=\"-\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px; float: left;\" />\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">NEWSLETTER</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/index.php/ct-menu-item-11\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"images/ebcbb8eb50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 500px; margin: 15px auto;\" width=\"520\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; color: #454545;\">am Samstag k&ouml;nnen wir wieder ein paar Tandemfl&uuml;ge anbieten. Geflogen wird ab 10:30 Uhr im Odenwald, genauer in Erlau.</p>\r\n<p>Anfahrts-/Gel&auml;ndebeschreibung gibts nach der Anmeldung.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; color: #454545;\">Termine 10:30 Uhr, 11:45 Uhr, 13:00 Uhr, 14:15 Uhr, 15:30 Uhr.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"images/1-passagier/1PLatzhalterbildTandem.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"212\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p>Wer Interesse hat mitzufliegen bitte bis heute Abend 18 Uhr, mit Uhrzeitangabe und Telefonnummer (Handy) per Mail, zur&uuml;ckmelden. Bitte wenn m&ouml;glich neben der Wunschuhrzeit auch eine alternative Uhrzeit angeben. Wir schicken dann abends die Anfahrtsbeschreibung mit Best&auml;tigung zu. Wie immer gilt - wer zuerst kommt, fliegt zuerst :-)!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><em><strong>Viele Gr&uuml;&szlig;e<br /></strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span> -&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -&nbsp; 69469 Weinheim -&nbsp; Germany<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><em>Telefon: </em></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)151 / 18836000</span></span></em></span></p>\r\n</address>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Sparkasse S&Uuml;W<br />IBAN: DE32 5485 0010 1700 1976 41&nbsp; <br />BIC: SOLADES1SUW<br /><br /></span><strong>Bitte tragen Sie uns in Ihr Adressbuch ein, <br />um einen einwandfreien Empfang zu erm&ouml;glichen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb;\" valign=\"bottom\" height=\"40px\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/bottom.png\" alt=\"---\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"info acyeditor_delete acyeditor_text\">Kein Interesse mehr am Newsletter? {unsubscribe}Unsubscribe{/unsubscribe}</div>\r\n</div>','SENT',NULL,'2016-05-06 05:09:31.000','2016-05-06 05:02:13.000','2026-09-20 10:04:36.601','TANDEM',133,61,0,1,'Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de','Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),('183a43ed-6d3f-4da1-a344-fe95ee0220cf','Mittwoch Flugschule geöffnet 16:30-19:30 Uhr','Mittwoch Flugschule geöffnet 16:30-19:30 Uhr',NULL,'<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%; background-color: #fff;\">\r\n<table style=\"text-align: justify; margin: auto; background-color: #ebebeb; border: 1px solid #e7e7e7; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #69b4c0; height: 38px;\" valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/top.png\" alt=\" - - - \" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 600px;\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" style=\"margin: auto; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #ebebeb; width: 520px;\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/message_icon.png\" alt=\"-\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px; float: left;\" />\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">NEWSLETTER</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 520px; margin: 15px auto;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</span></h3>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">morgen am Mittwoch sind wir wieder für euch in Weinheim im Shop, wer was braucht, oder mal quatschen will, wir sind von 16:30 - 19.30 Uhr für euch da!&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em><img src=\"images/parkplatzsymbol.jpg\" alt=\"parkplatzsymbol\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" /></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>Bitte in den umliegenden Straßen parken,&nbsp;die Parkplätze im&nbsp;Hof der Flugschule sind&nbsp;</em><em>den Anwohnern vorbehalten!&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Südafrika-Reise</strong></p>\r\n<p>Wir haben noch zwei Plätze für unsere Reise Nach Südafrika frei :-)!&nbsp;Wenn noch jemand mit möchte, meldet euch bitte so schnell es geht bei uns.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"images/2-tour-suedafrika/IMG_1123_1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"529\" height=\"397\" /><br />Anbei die Beschreibung der Reise:<br /><a href=\"https://www.fs-hirondelle.de/reisen-touren/süd-afrika-tour\">https://www.fs-hirondelle.de/reisen-touren/süd-afrika-tour</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">...mehr Infos rund ums\'s Gleitschirmfliegen, zu unseren Kursen und Reisen findet ihr auf unserer Website&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.fs-hirondelle.de/\">www.fs-hirondelle.de</a>&nbsp;sowie in unserem&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOwo0Wh2zoX_7nyArBdk_IQ\">YouTube-Kanal</a>&nbsp;- schaut einfach mal rein!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><em><strong>Luftige Grüße</strong></em></span><br /><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -&nbsp; 69469 Weinheim &nbsp;| &nbsp;Am Birnbach 6 - 76829 Landau<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><em>Telefon: </em></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">+49 (0)151 / 18836000</span></span></em></span></p>\r\n</address>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Sparkasse SÜW<br />IBAN: DE32 5485 0010 1700 1976 41&nbsp; <br />BIC: SOLADES1SUW</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=42:datenschutzerkl%C3%A4rung&amp;catid=2:allgemein\">Datenschutzerklärung</a></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 4px 1px 1px; line-height: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /></span><strong>Bitte tragen Sie uns in Ihr Adressbuch ein, <br />um einen einwandfreien Empfang zu ermöglichen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; height: 40px;\" valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/bottom.png\" alt=\"---\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"info acyeditor_delete acyeditor_text\">Kein Interesse mehr am Newsletter? {unsubscribe}Abmelden{/unsubscribe}</div>\r\n</div>','SENT',NULL,'2019-11-19 05:49:22.000','2019-11-19 05:41:45.000','2026-09-20 10:04:40.549','GENERAL',1525,708,0,1,'Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de','Flugschule Hirondelle','info@fs-hirondelle.de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),('1868d41c-c047-45b8-8f5c-bca3cd8250c1','Flugschule geöffnet Mittwoch, 24.1.24 16-19 Uhr','Flugschule geöffnet Mittwoch, 24.1.24 16-19 Uhr',NULL,'<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%; background-color: #fff;\">\r\n<table style=\"text-align: justify; margin: auto; background-color: #ebebeb; border: 1px solid #e7e7e7; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ebebeb\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr style=\"line-height: 0px;\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #69b4c0; height: 38px;\" valign=\"bottom\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/top.png\" alt=\" - - - \" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 600px;\">\r\n<table border=\"0\" style=\"margin: auto; width: 600px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #ebebeb; width: 520px;\"><img src=\"media/com_acymailing/templates/newsletter-4/message_icon.png\" alt=\"-\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px; float: left;\" />\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">NEWSLETTER</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n<tbody class=\"acyeditor_sortable\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"padding: 20px 0px; text-align: left; background-color: #fefefe; width: 520px;\"><a href=\"http://www.flugschule-hirondelle.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"images/Logo-H-web.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"92\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"acyeditor_delete\">\r\n<td style=\"background-color: #ebebeb; width: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td class=\"acyeditor_text\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dbdbdb; padding: 20px; width: 520px; margin: 15px auto;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\">Hallo {subtag:name|part:first|ucfirst},</span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>morgen am Mittwoch, 24.1.24 sind wir wieder für euch in der Flugschule in Weinheim. Wer was braucht oder quatschen will, schaut gerne vorbei.&nbsp;</span><strong>Meldet euch bitte vorab bei uns per E-Mail mit eurer Wunschuhrzeit an</strong><span>, damit wir das ein bissel koordinieren können und nicht alle auf einmal dastehen :-).&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"images/parkplatzsymbol.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>Bitte in den umliegenden Straßen parken,&nbsp;die Parkplätze im&nbsp;Hof der Flugschule sind&nbsp;</em><em>den Anwohnern vorbehalten!&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<br /><br /></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br />...mehr Infos rund ums\'s Gleitschirmfliegen, zu unseren Kursen und Reisen findet ihr auf unserer Website&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.fs-hirondelle.de/\">www.fs-hirondelle.de</a>&nbsp;sowie in unserem&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOwo0Wh2zoX_7nyArBdk_IQ\">YouTube-Kanal</a>&nbsp;- schaut einfach mal rein!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><em><strong>Luftige Grüße</strong></em></span><br /><span style=\"color: #3491b7;\"><strong><em>Team Hirondelle</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial,\'Arial Unicode MS\',Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Flugschule Hirondelle</span><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">Untergasse 27 -&nbsp; 69469 Weinheim &nbsp;| &nbsp;Am Birnbach 6 - 76829 Landau<br /></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin: 1px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<address style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 1px;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-top: 1px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-we